### 3.8 GET all orders to see what's been created
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/Orders
Accept: application/json

### 3.9 GET all order items with expanded book and order
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/OrderItems?$expand=book,order
Accept: application/json


