### 6.1 GET books with OData count
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$count=true
Accept: application/json

### 6.2 GET books with pagination 
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$top=5&$select=ID,title
Accept: application/json

### 6.3 GET books with sorting
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$orderby=price desc&$select=ID,title,price
Accept: application/json

### 6.4 GET books with multiple filters
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$filter=stock gt 10 and price lt 20&$select=ID,title,stock,price
Accept: application/json

### 6.5 Check service metadata
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/$metadata
Accept: application/xml

### 7.1 Get only ID and title (field selection)
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$select=ID,title
Accept: application/json

### 7.2 Filter books with stock > 10
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$filter=stock gt 10&$select=ID,title,stock
Accept: application/json

### 7.3 Sort books by stock (descending)
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$orderby=stock desc&$select=ID,title,stock
Accept: application/json

### 7.4 Limit to 3 books
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$top=3&$select=ID,title
Accept: application/json

### 7.5 Combined query (filter + sort + limit)
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$filter=stock gt 0&$orderby=price desc&$top=3&$select=ID,title,stock,price
Accept: application/json

### 7.6 Get a single book with expanded author
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books(251)?$expand=author
Accept: application/json

### 8.1 Get StockReport 
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/StockReport
Accept: application/json

### 8.2 StockReport filtered by OUT OF STOCK
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/StockReport?$filter=stockLevel eq 'OUT OF STOCK'
Accept: application/json

### 8.3 StockReport sorted by totalValue
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/StockReport?$orderby=totalValue desc
Accept: application/json

