### 16.1 Filter: books under $20
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$filter=price lt 20&$select=ID,title,price

### 16.2 Filter: books with stock > 100
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$filter=stock gt 100&$select=ID,title,stock

### 16.3 Filter: books by Poe
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$filter=author eq 'Edgar Allan Poe'&$select=ID,title

### 16.4 Filter: contains title 'Raven'
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$filter=contains(title,'Raven')

### 16.5 Filter: in stock AND cheap
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$filter=stock gt 0 and price lt 20&$select=ID,title,stock,price

### 17.1 Select only ID and title
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$select=ID,title

### 17.2 Order by price (cheapest first)
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$orderby=price asc&$select=ID,title,price

### 17.3 Top 3 most expensive
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$orderby=price desc&$top=3&$select=ID,title,price

### 17.4 Pagination: page 2, size 3
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$top=3&$skip=3&$select=ID,title

### 17.5 Count total books
GET {{baseUrl}}/browse/Books?$count=true

### 17.6 Combined: filter + sort + top + count
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/Books?$filter=stock gt 0&$orderby=price asc&$top=3&$count=true&$select=ID,title,stock,price

### 18.1 Book with author expanded
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/Books(201)?$expand=author

### 18.2 Book with author + genre
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/Books(201)?$expand=author,genre

### 18.3 Authors with their books
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/Authors?$expand=books&$select=ID,name

### 18.4 Three-level expand: Orders → items → book
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/Orders?$expand=items($expand=book)&$top=2

### 19.1 Authors with only in-stock books
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/Authors?$expand=books($filter=stock gt 0;$select=title,stock)

### 19.2 Authors with low-stock books (< 10), sorted
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/Authors?$expand=books($filter=stock lt 10;$select=title,stock;$orderby=stock asc)

### 19.3 Authors with cheap books (< $20)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/Authors?$expand=books($filter=price lt 20;$select=title,price)

### 19.4 Authors with high-stock books (> 100)
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/Authors?$expand=books($filter=stock gt 100;$select=title,stock)

### 20.1 Deep insert: order with 2 items in one request
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/Orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName": "Irisa Kellia",
    "status": "PENDING",
    "items": [
        { "book_ID": 201, "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 19.99 },
        { "book_ID": 251, "quantity": 2, "unitPrice": 15.99 }
    ]
}

### 20.2 Verify the deep insert
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/Orders?$expand=items&$orderby=ID desc&$top=1

### 20.3 Deep insert with 3 items
POST {{baseUrl}}/admin/Orders
Content-Type: application/json

{
    "customerName": "Bulk Order",
    "status": "PENDING",
    "items": [
        { "book_ID": 201, "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 19.99 },
        { "book_ID": 251, "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 15.99 },
        { "book_ID": 252, "quantity": 1, "unitPrice": 14.99 }
    ]
}

### 20.4 Verify last order with items and book details
GET {{baseUrl}}/admin/Orders?$expand=items($expand=book)&$orderby=ID desc&$top=1

